<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ-εργάζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>work under</i>: <i>plough up, prepare</i> for
			sowing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σπόρῳ νεὸν ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					16.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.2498.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.1.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρουραν εἰς σποράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					10.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>subdue, reduce</i>: pf. in pass. sense, <i>to be
				subdued,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπείργασμαι ψυχὴν ἔρωτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					504
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>do underhand</i> or <i>secretly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηρετέω</span>
			, <i>do a service</i>: pf. in pass. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλλ᾽ ὑπείργασται φίλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					871
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<i>produce gradually,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philum.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.45.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
